Z||000003||Ed||03-20-2001||12:15 AM||||I've had both an S-10 and my Fiero with the same problem you describe.  Problem was water in the motor unit.  After a while it will dry out.  Once the problem was caused by the mechanic flushing the radiator and getting fluid (splashing) into the motor unit.  ||||reg||1
